{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag League is an online PvP parkour game where you must use your movement and traversal skills to gain an advantage and beat the other team. Gather your friends and lobby up to play a selection of fun game modes where your parkour skill and movement come into play to experience these game modes to the fullest. With a wide range of motion, these classic modes are more exciting than ever... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAG GAME MODE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/extras/b462b7967c2af03cb43fff28843b792b.poster.avif?t=1755387642\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/extras/b462b7967c2af03cb43fff28843b792b.webm?t=1755387642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/extras/b462b7967c2af03cb43fff28843b792b.mp4?t=1755387642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in the 1v1/2v2 Tag game mode. Take turns playing the role of the tagger or runner and climb the scoreboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE DISCORD COMMUNITY!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/extras/15a6668e2d2dc1f6dceabad91ab61316.avif?t=1755387642\" width=608 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join now to connect with players, whether that's to host lobbies or host discussions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FREE RANGE PARKOUR MOVEMENT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/extras/38c1a36b178712fb16d9aa7fca8e0ac3.poster.avif?t=1755387642\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/extras/38c1a36b178712fb16d9aa7fca8e0ac3.webm?t=1755387642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/extras/38c1a36b178712fb16d9aa7fca8e0ac3.mp4?t=1755387642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bounce pads located around the map to gain a height advantage and reposition to avoid or gain leverage on your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climbing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaulting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Area Map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag Game Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamite Game Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the Flag Game Mode</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2642310?t=1755387642","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2642310?t=1755387642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/4bef1388a68bdb3fa8b31c11d95c1e6d4ebd546b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755387642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642310/4bef1388a68bdb3fa8b31c11d95c1e6d4ebd546b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755387642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descri